    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a two-person team passionate about tower defense and auto-battler games. We've created a turn-based tower defense game inspired by Chinese mythology and Eastern legends using \u300eCliCli\u300f. Join our discord, we hope you enjoy the game and look forward to your support and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy flexible, randomized recruitment mechanics with three tiers of hero cards and various synergy options to strengthen your tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/9e8c45c6e9a5c3b00e29fe4a93ec5925.poster.avif?t=1740453012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/9e8c45c6e9a5c3b00e29fe4a93ec5925.webm?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/9e8c45c6e9a5c3b00e29fe4a93ec5925.mp4?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenges and defeat elite enemies to earn rewards, unlock bounty missions, and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/f2635e08704872f272deedb65cf5702e.poster.avif?t=1740453012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/f2635e08704872f272deedb65cf5702e.webm?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/f2635e08704872f272deedb65cf5702e.mp4?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on reward monsters to test your team\u2019s output, enhancing the power and star ratings of your faction\u2019s 'Hero Towers' through an evolving economy. Defeat relentless beasts and become a legend!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/65eab69db7b660902df77bebbbd2be60.poster.avif?t=1740453012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/65eab69db7b660902df77bebbbd2be60.webm?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/65eab69db7b660902df77bebbbd2be60.mp4?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a two-person team passionate about tower defense and auto-battler games. We've created a turn-based tower defense game inspired by Chinese mythology and Eastern legends using \u300eCliCli\u300f. Join our discord, we hope you enjoy the game and look forward to your support and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy flexible, randomized recruitment mechanics with three tiers of hero cards and various synergy options to strengthen your tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/9e8c45c6e9a5c3b00e29fe4a93ec5925.poster.avif?t=1740453012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/9e8c45c6e9a5c3b00e29fe4a93ec5925.webm?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/9e8c45c6e9a5c3b00e29fe4a93ec5925.mp4?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenges and defeat elite enemies to earn rewards, unlock bounty missions, and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/f2635e08704872f272deedb65cf5702e.poster.avif?t=1740453012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/f2635e08704872f272deedb65cf5702e.webm?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/f2635e08704872f272deedb65cf5702e.mp4?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on reward monsters to test your team\u2019s output, enhancing the power and star ratings of your faction\u2019s 'Hero Towers' through an evolving economy. Defeat relentless beasts and become a legend!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/65eab69db7b660902df77bebbbd2be60.poster.avif?t=1740453012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/65eab69db7b660902df77bebbbd2be60.webm?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480750/extras/65eab69db7b660902df77bebbbd2be60.mp4?t=1740453012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Mystic Tower Legends is an Eastern fantasy-themed, turn-based tower defense game created with the game editing tool \u300eCliCli\u300f. Recruit legendary heroes from various mythologies, empower them, and strategize to defeat your foes!",
